#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SVT-AV1"
msgstr "Instalação do SVT-AV1"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "Install SVT-AV1 by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale SVT-AV1 executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:96
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:108
#, fuzzy, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "The test suite is very long and doesn't provide meaningful results. If you "
#| "want to test the results anyway, rebuild the package with <option>-D "
#| "BUILD_TESTING=ON</option>, then run <command>ninja test</command>. It "
#| "requires an Internet connection to run."
msgid ""
"The test suite is very long and doesn't provide meaningful results. If you "
"want to test the results anyway, issue <command>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON"
" &amp;&amp; ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>.  It requires an Internet "
"connection to run."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste é muito longa e não fornece resultados significativos. Se "
"você quiser testar os resultados mesmo assim, reconstrua o pacote com "
"<option>-D BUILD_TESTING=ON</option>, então execute <command>ninja "
"test</command>. Ela exige uma conexão com a Internet para executar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

